### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "bob_dev",
    "email": "bob.dev@example.com",
    "firstName": "Bob",
    "lastName": "Johnson",
    "role": "Developer",
    "projects": [
    "Project C",
    "Project D"
    ],
    "active": true,
    "joinedDate": "2023-10-26T11:00:00.000Z",
    "lastLoginIP": "192.168.1.101"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/67cf3ad3fa67385dab9f8e7f

